cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Earth in Extremes or adapt its analysis workflows, please cite this repository."
type: software

title: "Earth in Extremes"

authors:
  - family-names: "Kelvin"
    given-names: "Jaya"

abstract: >-
  Earth in Extremes is an open and reproducible project for investigating
  significant meteorological, oceanographic, hydrological, and related
  natural-hazard events using publicly accessible data and documented
  scientific methods.

repository-code: "https://github.com/jayakelvin/earth-in-extremes"

license: MIT

keywords:
  - meteorology
  - oceanography
  - extreme weather
  - natural hazards
  - atmospheric science
  - climate
  - geospatial analysis
  - open data
  - reproducible research
  - Python
